<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Irvine Apartment raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Irvine Apartment raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities said Friday it raised its intermediate-term rating on Irvine Apartment Communities Inc to outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- The real estate investment trust reported first quarter funds from operations of $0.48 a share earlier this week, up from $0.41 a year ago and slightly above EVEREN's estimates, analyst Burland East wrote in a research note.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Rents increased five percent, which is materially better than prior trends and reinforces our belief that southern California is clearly in recovery,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Irvine shares were unchanged at 26-3/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
